le_sha256" "e517ee431410b5324334d829cd70212e1403483115776c909364ceeb3ab125d4"} {"question" "e-4407" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $C=AB.$ What is the value of $c_{32}$, if\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13989257/example-4407.json" "file_sha256" "a65f3fc0cb670fd7cee239e88827fb65aa0089706c873a22883796632cffbee1"} {"question" "e-4407" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Multiplying the $3$rd row in $A$ by the $2$nd column in $B$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{32} & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =1\\cdot 4+2\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =4-4 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13989257/example-4407.json" "file_sha256" "a65f3fc0cb670fd7cee239e88827fb65aa0089706c873a22883796632cffbee1"} {"question" "e-5885" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Compute the product \n $\\left\\lbrack\n    \\matrix {\n       -1 \\\n \t0 \\\n        -2\n \t\n    }\n    \\right\\rbrack\n\n    \\left\\lbrack\n    \\matrix {\n        2 & -5\n    }\n    \\right\\rbrack.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13989257/example-5885.json" "file_sha256" "bdfff508f03b59f8de484ba5ef5c267c62cefa35bd00f493fbe01fb73ddcab6f"} {"question" "e-5885" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, the first factor is a $3 \\times 1$ matrix and the second factor is a $1 \\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere is $1$ column in the first matrix and $1$ row in the second matrix, so the product is well defined:\n\n$$\n\\bbox[lightgray, 2pt]{3} \\times 